# What `tilo-layout-check` finds in the shipped apps today, one finding id per line: these
# are known and do not fail the `layout-check` checks; a finding not named here does. Take a line
# out once its problem is fixed (the check says when one no longer shows).

# A setting names the look-alike glyphs it sets apart; the language's code-identifier rule reads
# a lone "l" or "O" as a binding name.
coded-name settings › settings_window › appearance_pane [ListRow]

# The setup card at a phone's width: its body overflows the card, its intro's words meet the
# icon, and the card keeps 8 px where a 320 px window keeps 16.
overflow onboarding › setup › stack [Container]
overlap onboarding › intro_page › ui.Text [Text]
cramped-gutter onboarding › setup › setup_card [ListRow]
